                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Auto-stop tolerance: the solver stops once the p, U and turbulence initial residuals all drop below this value (SIMPLE residualControl) — typically 30-60 % faster than running the full iteration count. Default 1e-4; 0 disables auto-stop (always runs all iterations).</item>
